Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.MolClinBreak
Column name: MolClin Type: STRING Description: flag indicating either molecular 'M', or clinical 'C'
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number, eg '15563'
Column name: InvNo Type: INT64 Description: investigation number, usually between 1 and 10
Column name: OrderNo Type: INT64 Description: order number, between 1 and 68
Column name: Breakpoint Type: STRING Description: breakpoint description, eg '19p13' or '12q2?3', etc
Sample rows:
[{'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 579, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '1'}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 2514, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '1'}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 5581, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '1'}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 6551, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '1'}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 7542, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '1'}]

